cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or build on this system, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "mozak — agent-maintained, program-agnostic knowledge graphs"
authors:
  - family-names: "Barachini"
    given-names: "Robert"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/RobertBarachini/mozak"
abstract: >-
  A template for agent-maintained knowledge graphs where plain Markdown is the
  single source of truth and every application (agent harness, Obsidian, Logseq,
  grep) is a replaceable lens. Forward links are wikilinks in note bodies;
  backlinks are derived, never stored. Ships an agent constitution (AGENTS.md),
  a frontmatter schema, stdlib-only link/annotation tooling, and a
  template-instance sync contract.
keywords:
  - knowledge-graph
  - personal-knowledge-management
  - ai-agents
  - zettelkasten
  - markdown
